--- /dev/null
+++ b/tests/README.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+MJPEG source stream host regression tests
+
+Run: bash tests/run_stream_tests.sh
+
+The C test includes the actual main/web_mjpeg.c, registers its real HTTP
+handler, and drives it with deterministic camera/HTTP/FreeRTOS stubs.
+It checks 5 FPS send cadence, send/capture delays, early tick wakeups,
+buffer ownership during waits, and all HTTP send error branches.
+
+These tests do not exercise ESP32 hardware, radio throughput, sensor capture
+freshness, USB flashing, or actual wall-clock FPS. Firmware build and
+on-device stream measurements remain separate checks.
